      "name": "dsh-sensitive-guard",
      "title": {
        "en": "Sensitive Guard — pre-gateway redaction",
        "zh": "敏感内容守卫 — 前置脱敏"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Pre-gateway sensitive content guard. Masks phones, IDs, bank cards, secrets, addresses and more before the prompt reaches the inbox or model; dual-direction scanning, image OCR, QR, recursive JSON and base64 decoding. Sensitive values are never written to session logs in plaintext.",
        "zh": "前置敏感内容守卫。在提示进入 inbox 或模型之前，脱敏手机、身份证、银行卡、密钥、住址等；支持双向扫描、图片 OCR、二维码、JSON 与 base64 递归解码。敏感值绝不以明文写入会话日志。"
      },
